.SH "نام (NAME)"
pkgctl-db \- Pacman database modification utility for package updates, moves, and more.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
pkgctl db [OPTIONS] [SUBCOMMAND]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Managing the Pacman database and facilitate the modification of packages and their metadata
within the database
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.RS 4
Display usage information and available options.
.RE
.SH "SUBCOMMANDS"
.sp
pkgctl db update
.RS 4
Update the binary repository as final release step
.RE
.sp
pkgctl db move
.RS 4
Move packages between binary repositories
.RE
.sp
pkgctl db remove
.RS 4
Remove packages from binary repositories
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
pkgctl\-db\-update(1)
pkgctl\-db\-move(1)
pkgctl\-db\-remove(1)
.SH "HOMEPAGE"
.sp
\fI\c
.URL "https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/devtools" "" "\fP"
.sp
